    </div>
    <div class="mindmap">
      <div class="mm-root">🏤 डाकघर के विभाग / Departments Part A</div>
      <div class="mm-branches">
        <div class="mm-node mm-b"><h4>📨 डाक-संचालन / Mail Side</h4>
          <ul><li>Mail Dept → Mail Clerk</li><li>Sorting Dept → Sorting Clerk</li><li>Delivery Dept → Delivery Clerk</li><li>Deposit Dept → Deposit Clerk</li></ul></div>
        <div class="mm-node mm-r"><h4>📦 मूल्यवान वस्तु / Valuables</h4>
          <ul><li>Registration Dept → Registration Clerk</li><li>Parcel Dept → Parcel Clerk</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
