<div class="part" id="p5">
<div class="wrap">
<section class="block">
  <div class="block-body">
    <div class="mindmap">
      <div class="mm-branches">
        <div class="mm-node mm-g"><h4>💵 धन-संबंधी / Money Side</h4>
          <ul><li>Money Order Dept → MO Clerk</li><li>Savings Bank Dept → SB Clerk</li><li>Cash Dept → <b>Treasurer</b></li></ul></div>
        <div class="mm-node mm-gr"><h4>🧾 लेखा / Accounts</h4>
          <ul><li>Sub-Account Dept → Sub-Account Clerk</li><li>SO में treasurer न हो तो SPM ही treasurer</li></ul></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mnq"><div class="mtitle">🧠 Mnemonic — विभागों का क्रम याद रखें:</div>
      <div class="mword">"MSD-D RP SMS C"</div>
      <ul><li><b>M</b>ail, <b>S</b>orting, <b>D</b>elivery, <b>D</b>eposit → <b>R</b>egistration, <b>P</b>arcel → <b>S</b>ub-account, <b>M</b>oney order, <b>S</b>avings bank → <b>C</b>ash</li>
      <li>याद रखें: "<b>धोनी (MSD)</b> ने <b>D</b>elhi में <b>RP</b> को <b>SMS</b> कर <b>C</b>ash माँगा!"</li></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
</div>
